// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1553526520" "In the wake of Archon Swann's revelation about an anti-Nictus faction within the Council at the end of the Cosmotron incident, we've been monitoring the Council very closely, looking for any trace of this group within the Council. Now Moonfire thinks that she's found something, and has asked for you to speak to her on Striga Island."
// AcceptString :
"P1349230832" "Speak to Moonfire on Striga Island"
// SendOffString :
"P1140494419" "I'll let Moonfire tell you what she's found herself. This could be very interesting indeed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Kheldian_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2443215153" "Speak With Moonfire on Striga"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P910285603" "I think Moonfire may be onto something big. You should speak with her as soon as you can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
