// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2836184014" "Moonfire was correct. These weapons appear to be tuned specifically to fight beings like the Nictus. I guess that they'll have a strong effect against creatures of the Pantheon as well, since they are controlled by an energy being of sorts. What I don't understand is why a Warwolf and a Galaxy Archon were helping to test them. There's more going on here, and I think that this is just the beginning of something big."
// RandomFameString :
"P3349160841" "I hear that something big is brewing on Striga Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Kheldian_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1532025097" "We have some people looking at the Quantum Dispersal weapons you recovered, but there are still a lot of unanswered questions about what was going on in those caves. One of the things that troubles me is if they were testing anti-Nictus weapons, why were Warwolves and Galaxy troops helping them? We've done some investigation, and found the base where Archon Booker was stationed. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>There may be some clues to his motivations there if you can get in and retrieve them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2286508159" "Infiltrate a Galaxy base to learn about Booker."
// SendOffString :
"P494884458" "Booker isn't talking, but others did mention that he kept journals. If you can find them, it might help us why he's conspiring against the Nictus. It might also identify other members of the conspiracy. <br>You only need to find Booker's journals. If you want to fight or you have to fight, you can, but it's not necessary."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P312717053" "Investigate Booker's journals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P436690686" "Booker's journals could tell us a lot. You don't have to fight if you can avoid it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1479456931" "This base is being used exclusively by Arakhn's Galaxy troops."

