// Dialog :
"P2741674935" "You found 2 of Archon Booker's journals."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2338375655" "These journals are interesting reading. Booker clearly feels like he's being transformed into something he doesn't like by the Nictus fragment implants he received. He chose to fight against it by joining this group, knowing full well that if they succeed it could be the death of him. I just wonder what he learned about Arakhn that made him snap. <br>More practically, we know about Archon Swann, and have him in custody. However, Archon Coster is a new name to this investigation, and from the journal it sounds like he was closer to the conspiracy than Swann. We'll start investigating immediately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Kheldian_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P277013443" "We've done some research on the name you found in Booker's journal, 'Archon Coster'. It turns out that Coster runs a research-oriented facility on Striga Island. A research facility that was working on new applications of Arakhn's Quantum technology. I think we may have learned what those new applications are. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We've been able to locate Coster's facility, and I would like you to go in and catch him there.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1270248149" "Catch Archon Coster in his lab."
// SendOffString :
"P1071516372" "Catching Coster is the most important thing. He can tell us more about the conspiracy, and anything he says about these Quantum Dispersal guns could help Dr. Winslowe and his team to reverse-engineer them. He may not be willing to talk, so also keep an eye out for any other information you can find."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2600085680" "Catch Archon Coster"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1069937447" "Coster and the information in the base is the most important thing. It could lead us right to the heart of the conspiracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
