"P1156773760" "You found some paperwork on Archon Turley"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3391975692" "You captured Archon Turley and Lt. Wester, and discovered that the remaining conspirators are planning to evacuate Striga Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1053903972" "Good work, you captured both of them before they could get away or Arakhn could get to Turley. If they're planning to leave Striga and defect to another organization, we have to stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Kheldian_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3000077080" "The two remaining heads of the Conspiracy are preparing to escape Striga Isle, and the Center's personal guard are leading the attack to re-capture them now that Arakhn has let him know about the conspiracy. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This is the last chance we're going to have to catch them ourselves</A>. After this is over, they'll be beyond our reach, one way or another."
// AcceptString :
"P3387476349" "Catch the last two conspirators before they leave Striga"
// SendOffString :
"P2394509407" "Archon Saager and Archon Voight are the last two leaders of the conspiracy still free, and they're planning to keep it that way. They've loaded up a tanker-ship with their loyalists, and plan to take it to the Rogue Isles. We can't let that happen. The information they know about the Nictus activity within the Council could change everything. What they know about Arakhn's schemes and Requiem's plots will keep the heroes of the city busy for months, and set the Council back years."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P581139476" "Catch Archon Saager & Voight"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P902108869" "You need to hurry to that ship. Saager and Voight could escape at any moment!"

